      },
      "answerText": "(a − b)(−c) > 0 by POS 1",
      "solution": [
        "a − b > 0 and −c > 0.",
        "(a − b)(−c) > 0 by POS 1.",
        "(a − b)(−c) = bc − ac. So bc − ac > 0, that is ac < bc."
      ],
      "langType": "§4 ex. 1",
      "hints": [
        "Use $-c > 0$."
